  "rule": "`build` copies each contract into coverage.json `contracts[]` with `renderIn` resolved to paths: the 4 rendered files of the owner of `anchorTool` (scope `owner-of:<tool>`) or of every skill (scope `every-skill`), plus the 4 rendered files of each id in `skills`. `lpmRequires` is the exact §7.1 content; the published `tools`/`phrases`/files must be a superset of it. Tool matches use /(?<![a-z0-9_])<tool>(?![a-z0-9_])/; phrases are substrings.",
